Date: 2026-04-23 22:22:05

Problem: ensurePartitions tries to CREATE PARTITION OF positions, but positions is a TimescaleDB hypertable.
Hypertables auto-manage chunks; native partition DDL fails with 'is not partitioned (SQLSTATE 42P17)'.

ensurePartitions (line 183): tables := []string{"positions"} — only table is hypertable
cleanOldPartitions (line 218): only called for "positions" at line 60
Both functions operate exclusively on hypertables — remove entirely.

=== REASONING ===
positions is a hypertable (created in 000001_create_hypertables / 000145_create_hypertables).
TimescaleDB automatically creates and manages time-based chunks for hypertables.
Native CREATE TABLE ... PARTITION OF fails because the table is not natively partitioned.

